 Build

To include this library in your project, copy the following into your build.gradle :

 gradle
repositories {
 maven {
 name = "Modrinth"
 url = "https://api.modrinth.com/maven"
 content {
 includeGroup "maven.modrinth"
 }
 }
}


 gradle
